        <h2>The short version</h2>
        <p>I'm Kaine Cruickshanks. I was a plumbing apprentice. In February 2026 I left the trade to build CopyByKaine, because I could see the same thing happening to good tradesmen everywhere: brilliant at the actual work, getting hammered on the marketing side.</p>
        <p>They'd try Facebook ads, get a handful of tyre-kickers, and decide ads don't work. Or they'd hire an agency that ran generic campaigns and dumped cold form-fills on them with no way to tell the real jobs from the time-wasters. Meanwhile the work they were producing was genuinely good. The gap wasn't the trade. It was everything between finishing a great job and getting the next homeowner to pick up the phone.</p>
        <p>So I set out to fix that one thing, properly, for trades across Scotland.</p>

        <h2>Who I work with</h2>
        <p>I'm based in Edinburgh and work with trades right across Scotland. Right now that includes Wüsch, an exterior cleaning company I've run ads for since April 2026, and a bespoke wardrobe company in Edinburgh I've worked with since May 2026. Both are still going.</p>
